    <!-- Deliberately a plain Win32 project rather than the ApplicationType
         "Windows Store" that iRASPA.vcxproj declares: that type force-includes
         platform.winmd, which wants a WinRT compilation mode the kits do not use.
         Nothing that matters for linking into the app differs between the two - the
         CRT, the WINAPI family and the SDK library paths keep their desktop
         defaults as long as WindowsAppContainer stays false, which it is here. -->
